                                                "sense_id": "051c4070-c45d-3ab5-9e68-902af3e8f338",
                                                "text": "The male widow-bird, remarkable for his caudal plumes, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9783aa19-aea1-495c-ad21-7cd8cc0d0b33",
                                                "sense_id": "051c4070-c45d-3ab5-9e68-902af3e8f338",
